Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.97,0:00:07.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}This is Mission Architect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.31,0:00:11.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A game for one to four players, where your team becomes a real mission team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:13.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Pick a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.36,0:00:18.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Watch Egypt's farms from orbit, hunt for ice on the Moon, or land a rover on Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.31,0:00:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}First, every player learns their role, with short, hands-on lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.93,0:00:26.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Then you build the spacecraft together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.57,0:00:30.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Every choice costs mass, power, money, or data.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:34.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Live meters show how one decision changes everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.47,0:00:36.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You can launch, even with mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.95,0:00:40.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The flight shows you exactly what goes wrong, and why.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.57,0:00:42.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In space, surprises happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.03,0:00:45.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}You get thirty seconds and four choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.75,0:00:48.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Every choice works, but each one has a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.93,0:00:50.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}A good design keeps you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.21,0:00:55.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}At the end, your report scores the mission, and compares it with the real NASA mission.
